action as speculative.\n", "raw_response": "{\n  \"target_molecule\": \"L-Proline\",\n  \"overall_strategy\": \"The synthesis network interconnects all literature-supported or credible prebiotic routes to proline, each mapped from its geochemical context. The main mechanistic route is the cyanosulfidic photoredox sequence (Patel et al., 2015), with branching points reflecting competition with arginine, and the fate of intermediates. Supplementary, less-resolved but plausible routes (spark discharge, extraterrestrial ices, parent-body aqueous chemistry, hydrothermal ornithine/arginine pyrolysis, and hypothetical metabolism-first cycles from glutamate) are included as individual pathways, with explicit disclaimer where reaction steps lack experimental demonstration. The network also incorporates the critical hydrolysis and chiral amplification steps (the only plausible source of L-proline), and marks contested or speculative steps per the literature.\",\n  \"molecules\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_001\",\n      \"formula\": \"HCN\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"Hydrogen cyanide\",\n      \"common_name\": \"hydrogen cyanide\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/CHN/c1-2/h1H\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_002\",\n      \"formula\": \"C2H2\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"Ethyne\",\n      \"common_name\": \"acetylene\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/C2H2/c1-2/h1-2H\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_003\",\n      \"formula\": \"NH3\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"Azane\",\n      \"common_name\": \"ammonia\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/H3N/h1H3\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_004\",\n      \"formula\": \"H2S\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"Sulfan\",\n      \"common_name\": \"hydrogen sulfide\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/H2S/h1H2\",\n      \"role\": \"